## `@mutates` promovido por `fundere`.
##
## El receptor de la mutación es siempre el campo del embed: el embed no sabe
## que forma parte de un host, así que no puede mutarlo entero.
rune Core:
    n as int

enchanting Core:
    @mutates
    weave bumped with dx as int into Core:
        return with n is self->n + dx

rune Mid fundere Core:
    mid as int

rune Top fundere Mid:
    top as int

weave main into int:
    # 1. Forma de sentencia sobre un embed promovido.
    var t as Top is with mid is (with core is (with n is 1), mid is 2), top is 3
    calling t.bumped with 10
    if t.core.n != 11:
        return 1
    if t.top != 3:
        return 2
    # 2. Promoción recursiva: el receptor es `t.mid.core`.
    calling t.mid.bumped with 1
    if t.core.n != 12:
        return 3
    # 3. Dentro de `with:` el receptor es el host direccionado.
    with t:
        calling .bumped with 100
    if t.core.n != 112:
        return 4
    # 4. Forma pura `get_<metodo>`: no muta el receptor.
    var copy as Core is calling t.get_bumped with 5
    if copy.n != 117:
        return 5
    if t.core.n != 112:
        return 6
    # 5. Un método propio del host gana al promovido.
    var c as Core is with n is 0
    var r as Mid is with core is c, mid is 9
    calling r.bumped with 3
    if r.core.n != 3:
        return 7
    return 0
